{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"cb681b80e53fd530abf53f1c10c6c71ef9a2bd81e11935c38b554b98eb2da772","ja":"さらに数日後。\n5人は、テレビ番組にゲスト出演することに……","zh":"又过了几天。\n5人决定作为嘉宾出演电视节目……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"df423ac987e19279c95f3dba1bef0cbe07f5b69949f47d7a1c65d1d62189a80f","ja":"「なんと今日は！\n今話題の5人に遊びに来てもらいました～！」","zh":"「今天竟然！\n请到了当下备受瞩目的5位来做客～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"36bb537e94854b2b68cde856de1729ae36699c64641fc3324a9130071f8e6f78","ja":"みなさん、こんにちは！\n訳アリ教祖・モーガンを演じる最上静香です！","zh":"大家好！\n我是饰演心怀隐情的教祖摩根的最上静香！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7a0d51e059b88415d504ffe9c87e09e765cd62f556c415876dc7db63159d41c1","ja":"スタークス役のミキなの☆\n元刑事さんなんだけど、牢屋に入れられてるんだよ！","zh":"美希演的是斯塔克斯哦☆\n虽然以前是刑警，但现在被关在牢里呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f61d7d2b9c85f530b3a8e8e6a5bca0db1b7276692095dfe842d28624ccca7d90","ja":"アタシはハーマンっていう役で、その……\nダメだ！　何を言ってもネタバレになっちゃいそう！","zh":"我演的角色叫赫尔曼，那个……\n不行！感觉不管说什么都会剧透！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ecc2cc5fd736976eb4ad2d5e20f5cbdbabc431d912680fc384b60f2b3709a03c","ja":"わ、私は……\nは、犯罪者のゼノビアという役です……！","zh":"我、我是……\n饰、饰演罪犯杰诺维亚这个角色……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8da2cbc34d9932c79b0a728e5ddcf63b843b61b7436a782b5983234d67c76130","ja":"わたしが演じるイーサンは、マフィアのボスです！\nわたしたちみーんな、『ちょいワル』な役なんだよ！","zh":"我饰演的伊森是黑手党老大！\n我们大～家演的都是“坏坏”的角色哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"bed5f7769335647578203f6d8725806d5de70c47e0c5240eb34cfec12a22fc18","ja":"「そんなヴィランな5人が、ゴミ拾いをしていたと\nニュースになりましたね？」","zh":"“新闻上报道说，就是这样反派的5个人，\n却跑去捡垃圾了对吧？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"554732ef6e212560b712700ae24409084013d57e0826da2d2005c7595d3d2ac8","ja":"そうなの！　ミキたちがお仕事した隣の\nイベント会場で、ゴミがたくさん散らかってたんだよ。","zh":"就是这样！美希她们工作现场旁边的\n活动会场里，到处都散落着好多垃圾哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"99c7c1898e692f5d8e4c93371172b5655601f888a880e1b8b6166c9054244615","ja":"静香が気づいて、ゴミ拾いを始めたから、\nミキたちも一緒にやったの。","zh":"静香先发现了，然后开始捡垃圾，\n所以美希她们也跟着一起捡了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"bc24996df73e82e32cdb28a1fc3449dbc33ad96108e2babfb85106d1ffc40884","ja":"わ、私はただ、自分にできることを\nしたかっただけで……！","zh":"我、我只是想做些\n自己力所能及的事而已……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0","ja":"パチパチパチパチ！","zh":"啪啪啪啪！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e2e7508baacb9e9da5a367358f4f9b3d8c92668b90ef26919c9229ab46bc234c","ja":"「素晴らしいですね！\nそんな皆さんに、視聴者から質問が届いていますよ！」","zh":"“太棒了！\n观众给这样的各位送来了提问哦！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"c4eb775024b510b6a5b564eb974cceb51d4ef9095fa2e5bf27a0ea358bbf2424","ja":"「6歳の女の子から！\n「みんな本当はいい人なんですか？」だそうです！」","zh":"“来自一位6岁女孩子的来信！\n说是问‘大家其实都是好人吗？’！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"431d4d961d9f4b8e0ced2f1d8a2343362ed57e7c71068da8e581b60eac967e8a","ja":"えっ、ええっ！？","zh":"诶，诶诶！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"0833387460cc54fb978ee48452746d0135122cb1111961929f19261fe342f5e8","ja":"あはっ☆　面白い質問なの☆","zh":"啊哈☆　真是个有趣的问题呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"294cff8828da4fd0a91d0df7652bd1e5a39b0bf5341702818be0e2f27bbbc8dd","ja":"ええとですね、その……\n本当はいい人かどうかっていうのは……。","zh":"那个嘛，就是……\n至于实际上是不是个好人嘛……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"bfa028a501a3b0736e60e02d90749741d9d48ba24308ff546ed73f9af75f76cf","ja":"げ、劇を見に来てもらったら、\nわかると思います……！","zh":"如、如果是来看话剧的话，\n我想就能明白了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1070.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"65eadafba1ab29c769357cba9dcfa563d8658ff590607e470d8425ea374bfd53","ja":"そうなの☆　だから……\nみんな、ミキたちに会いに来てね～～～！","zh":"就是这样哦☆　所以……\n大家，都要来看美希她们哦～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
